  "prefLabel": "Env-A 303.03 Measurement for PM Attainment Determinations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 303.03 Measurement for PM Attainment Determinations. For the purpose of determining attainment of the primary and secondary ambient air quality standards for PM specified in Env-A 303.01, the following shall apply:\n\n(a) PM10 in the ambient air shall be measured by either:\n\n(1) A reference method based on 40 CFR 50 Appendix J and designated in accordance with 40 CFR 53; or\n\n(2) An equivalent method designated in accordance with 40 CFR 53; and\n\n(b) PM2.5 in the ambient air shall be measured by either:\n\n(1) A reference method based on 40 CFR 50 Appendix L and designated in accordance with 40 CFR 53; or\n\n(2) An equivalent method designated in accordance with 40 CFR 53.\n\nSource. #120, eff 8-31-73; ss by #461, eff 4-20-74; ss by #1333, eff 4-1-79; ss by #1614, eff 7-30-80; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6227, eff 4-25-96; ss by #8054, eff 2-28-04; ss by #10173, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13382, eff 5-25-22",
